---
const finishes = [
  {
    number: '01',
    name: 'Golden Teak Emboss',
    description: 'Hangat & natural',
    image: '/images/momo/finishes/golden-teak-emboss.jpg',
  },
  {
    number: '02',
    name: 'Warm White Emboss',
    description: 'Terang & minimalis',
    image: '/images/momo/finishes/warm-white-emboss.jpg',
  },
  {
    number: '03',
    name: 'Black Rosewood',
    description: 'Elegan & tegas',
    image: '/images/momo/finishes/black-rosewood.jpg',
  },
  {
    number: '04',
    name: 'Siam Rosewood',
    description: 'Klasik & berkarakter',
    image: '/images/momo/finishes/siam-rosewood.jpg',
  },
  {
    number: '05',
    name: 'Pearl White',
    description: 'Bersih & modern',
    image: '/images/momo/finishes/pearl-white.jpg',
  },
];
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white border-t border-b border-zinc-200" id="finishing">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-10">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <div class="w-4 h-0.5 bg-momo-red"></div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-momo-red">
            FINISHING PALETTE
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          Sentuhan akhir,<br />
          <span class="font-editorial-italic font-normal">karakter berbeda.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
        Warna dan tekstur dapat mengubah rasa sebuah ruang. Kenali beberapa pilihan finishing yang ditampilkan dalam katalog.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Swatches Row with Real Texture Photos -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      {finishes.map((finish) => (
        <div class="group cursor-pointer">
          <div class="w-full aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm border border-zinc-200 bg-stone-100 mb-3 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:-translate-y-1">
            <img
              src={finish.image}
              alt={`Tekstur finishing ${finish.name}`}
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
              width="240"
              height="180"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-black/75 text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-xs">
              {finish.number}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900 group-hover:text-momo-red transition-colors">
            {finish.name}
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500">{finish.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Color Sample Notice -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-50 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-momo-red shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z" fill-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
      <span>
        Warna di layar dapat berbeda dari material aslinya. Selalu konfirmasi sampel finishing sebelum melakukan pemesanan.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
